    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0241" n="975" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg975"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Sill.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1896</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Minister, Seoul:</hi></p>
                <p>Your dispatches Nos. 175, 176, and 177 received. Your course in continued
                    intermeddling with Korean political affairs in violation of repeated
                    instructions noted with astonishment and emphatic disapproval. Cable briefly any
                    explanation you have to make; also answer whether you intend to comply with
                    instructions given.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
